    "There are two kinds of intelligence, intuitiveness vs careful planning. in music some composers write down their music, and others just improvise on the spot. I think there are 2 kinds of programmers, many , maybe most, are of the kind that when compared to a painter, like to sit down with a ruler and a pencil and slowly draw a picture, making realistic pictures.... and then there are programmers like me, that when compared with a painter worry more about the end product than how to do the thing... so they may get out a bucket of paint, and slap some on the walls, have dirty newspapers on the floor everywhere(and they end up with some kind of abstract Picasso like painting).. but I think this kind of programming is better for inventive people... probably not for like business or medical applications.....": [
      "There are two kinds of intelligence, intuitiveness vs careful planning. in music some composers write down their music, and others just improvise on the spot. I think there are 2 kinds of programmers, many , maybe most, are of the kind that when compared to a painter, like to sit down with a ruler and a pencil and slowly draw a picture, making realistic pictures.... and then there are programmers like me, that when compared with a painter worry more about the end product than how to do the thing... so they may get out a bucket of paint, and slap some on the walls, have dirty newspapers on the floor everywhere(and they end up with some kind of abstract Picasso like painting).. but I think this kind of programming is better for inventive people... probably not for like business or medical applications.....",
      "2つの種類の知能があります 直感性と慎重な計画です 音楽では作曲家の中には 楽譜を書き込み 他の作曲者は即刻即興します 絵画家と比べると 2種類のプログラマーがいると思います 絵画家と比べると 鉛筆とローラを持って座って ゆっくりと絵を描いて 現実的な絵を描くようなタイプです そして私のようなプログラマーもいます 絵画家と比べると 作品の仕上がりについて 心配する方が多いのです",
      "Hay dos tipos de inteligencia, intuitividad frente a la planificación cuidadosa. en la música algunos compositores escriben su música, y otros simplemente improvisan en el lugar. Creo que hay 2 tipos de programadores, muchos, tal vez la mayoría, son del tipo que cuando se compara con un pintor, como sentarse con un gobernante y un lápiz y dibujar lentamente una imagen, haciendo imágenes realistas.... y luego hay programadores como yo, que cuando se compara con un pintor se preocupan más por el producto final que cómo hacer la cosa... por lo que pueden sacar un cubo de pintura, y bofetadas algunas en las paredes, tienen periódicos sucios en el suelo por todas partes (y terminan con algún tipo de Picasso abstracto como la pintura). pero creo que este tipo de programación es mejor para la gente inventiva... probablemente no para aplicaciones comerciales o médicas..."
    ],
    "There is a guy that decided to make an OS from scratch. And not just any OS, but an OS that is a temple dedicated to God. He's obviously quite a religious extremist. this is quite an advanced OS, which includes many games and tools for example an IDE which instead of displaying just the filename of a 3d model in the editor, it actually displays the 3d model inside the editor with the code.": [
      "There is a guy that decided to make an OS from scratch. And not just any OS, but an OS that is a temple dedicated to God. He's obviously quite a religious extremist. this is quite an advanced OS, which includes many games and tools for example an IDE which instead of displaying just the filename of a 3d model in the editor, it actually displays the 3d model inside the editor with the code.",
      "ゼロからオペレーティングシステムを 作ろうとした人がいます 神に捧げられた神殿です. 3Dモデルのファイル名を編集者に表示する代わりに 3Dモデルのコードを編集者の内部に表示します 3Dモデルのファイル名を編集者に表示する代わりに 3Dモデルを編集者に表示します",
      "Hay un tipo que decidió hacer un sistema operativo desde cero. Y no sólo cualquier sistema operativo, sino un sistema operativo que es un templo dedicado a Dios. Obviamente es un extremista religioso. este es un sistema operativo bastante avanzado, que incluye muchos juegos y herramientas por ejemplo un IDE que en lugar de mostrar sólo el nombre de archivo de un modelo 3d en el editor, en realidad muestra el modelo 3D dentro del editor con el código."
    ],
    "This hypothesis deals with the problem of infinite regression of the universe, which states that “if time is infinite how did we ever get to this point in time when there are an infinite amount of moments between the beginning and now\", because this hypothesis does propose that time is infinite but has a beginning that everyone is currently going through one part of time which starts at the beginning and ends at the end. but every part of the trip has always existed.": [
      "This hypothesis deals with the problem of infinite regression of the universe, which states that “if time is infinite how did we ever get to this point in time when there are an infinite amount of moments between the beginning and now\", because this hypothesis does propose that time is infinite but has a beginning that everyone is currently going through one part of time which starts at the beginning and ends at the end. but every part of the trip has always existed.",
      "この仮説は,宇宙の無限回帰の問題に取り組んでおり,この仮説は\"時間と今の間には無限数の瞬間があるのに,時間が無限であるのに,すべての人が現在,始まりから始まり,終わりに終わる時間の1つの部分を通過しているという始まりがあるからです. しかし,旅のすべての部分は常に存在しています.",
      "Esta hipótesis trata del problema de la regresión infinita del universo, que afirma que \"si el tiempo es infinito cómo llegamos a este punto en el tiempo cuando hay una cantidad infinita de momentos entre el principio y ahora\", porque esta hipótesis propone que el tiempo sea infinito pero tiene un comienzo que cada uno está pasando por una parte del tiempo que comienza al principio y termina al final. pero cada parte del viaje siempre ha existido."
    ],
